<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling WAS unchanged against the dollar but fell against the pound, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Monday.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 624.6900 to the dollar, unchanged since Friday. Against the pound it exchanged at 1021.6837 compared to Friday's 1018.4649.</p>
<p>Last Monday the shilling exchanged at 624.7593 to the dollar.</p>
